          "document_end": 315,
          "text": "在键合图中，键合图因果律不仅是一种数学工具，能够记录下系统中因果关系的形式和顺序而为系统模型的分析和模拟计算提供完整的信息流，同时它也是一种物理意义上因果关系直觉感受的一种体现和表述，也同样能够表述出真实系统物理量之间的因果关系，从而反映出能量和信息在系统时间、空间上的传播及过程。",
          "section_id": "section_2cbc5db9c64e",
          "start": 174,
          "end": 315,
          "chunk_start": 174,
          "chunk_end": 315,
          "sentence_document_start": 174,
          "sentence_document_end": 315,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_362bde04ff21c845bfa3",
          "document_start": 317,
          "document_end": 337,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
          "section_id": "section_2cbc5db9c64e",
          "start": 317,
          "end": 337,
          "chunk_start": 317,
          "chunk_end": 337,
          "sentence_document_start": 317,
          "sentence_document_end": 337,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_9eeddb4b33e48d286b8f",
          "document_start": 338,
          "document_end": 347,
          "text": "# 二、因果关系;",
          "section_id": "section_2cbc5db9c64e",
          "start": 338,
          "end": 347,
          "chunk_start": 338,
          "chunk_end": 347,
          "sentence_document_start": 338,
          "sentence_document_end": 347,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_458b23331ff50d3abde6",
          "document_start": 348,
          "document_end": 380,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_2cbc5db9c64e",
          "start": 348,
          "end": 380,
          "chunk_start": 348,
          "chunk_end": 380,
          "sentence_document_start": 348,
          "sentence_document_end": 380,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_49ba206f987a337bd987",
          "document_start": 382,
          "document_end": 452,
          "text": "键合图因果律和能量的关系：在物理系统的网状模型中，信息交换只在沿功率流的方向上进行，很自然会将这种物理的相互作用同一双边的信号流联系在一起。",
          "section_id": "section_2cbc5db9c64e",
          "start": 382,
          "end": 452,
          "chunk_start": 382,
          "chunk_end": 452,
          "sentence_document_start": 382,
          "sentence_document_end": 452,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_9c48b52c8f946ed051f5",
          "document_start": 452,
          "document_end": 481,
          "text": "在键合图中，这种双向流动的信号流具体来讲体现为功率的传递。",
          "section_id": "section_2cbc5db9c64e",
          "start": 452,
          "end": 481,
          "chunk_start": 452,
          "chunk_end": 481,
          "sentence_document_start": 452,
          "sentence_document_end": 481,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_fb4228134f4c0783352b",
          "document_start": 481,
          "document_end": 691,
          "text": "在现代一个复杂的系统中，监测和控制通常是必须的，而相对于整个系统的能量基准来讲，这样局部的信号的传递所消耗的能量微乎其微，或者是其所供给的能量和系统的运动完全不相干，我们只是为了获得一便于控制和监测的单向的信号并对之进行适当的处理，因此为了建模和计算的方便，可假设其所消耗的功率恒为零，如后介绍的零功率键，但是因果律对这样的局部仍然是成立的，而且对这样局部以及它对大系统的的接口的分析也必须遵循键合图因果律的定义和构成。",
          "section_id": "section_2cbc5db9c64e",
          "start": 481,
          "end": 691,
          "chunk_start": 481,
          "chunk_end": 691,
          "sentence_document_start": 481,
          "sentence_document_end": 691,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_cf3f2fc9464738af9d6a",
          "document_start": 693,
          "document_end": 713,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
          "section_id": "section_2cbc5db9c64e",
          "start": 693,
          "end": 713,
          "chunk_start": 693,
          "chunk_end": 713,
          "sentence_document_start": 693,
          "sentence_document_end": 713,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_727688902557d55547d7",
          "document_start": 714,
          "document_end": 723,
          "text": "# 二、因果关系;",
          "section_id": "section_2cbc5db9c64e",
          "start": 714,
          "end": 723,
          "chunk_start": 714,
          "chunk_end": 723,
          "sentence_document_start": 714,
          "sentence_document_end": 723,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_5e7f7e1b3e5471b0666c",
          "document_start": 724,
          "document_end": 756,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_2cbc5db9c64e",
          "start": 724,
          "end": 756,
          "chunk_start": 724,
          "chunk_end": 756,
          "sentence_document_start": 724,
          "sentence_document_end": 756,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_23fc217e184cc53e61e3",
          "document_start": 758,
          "document_end": 837,
          "text": "键合图因果律和边界条件：一个状态确定的系统模型，其内部关系总可以体现为一定的因果律，这种模型的建立总依赖形于外部定义的模型假设，这种假设加强了系统的边界条件。",
          "section_id": "section_2cbc5db9c64e",
          "start": 758,
          "end": 837,
          "chunk_start": 758,
          "chunk_end": 837,
          "sentence_document_start": 758,
          "sentence_document_end": 837,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_ee669074bc5118fb6ab1",
          "document_start": 837,
          "document_end": 882,
          "text": "对于一个系统模型来讲，要实现模型的强制运动，实现运动的可预测性，其边界条件就必须是充分的。",
          "section_id": "section_2cbc5db9c64e",
          "start": 837,
          "end": 882,
          "chunk_start": 837,
          "chunk_end": 882,
          "sentence_document_start": 837,
          "sentence_document_end": 882,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_ef577d23c500160493a8",
          "document_start": 882,
          "document_end": 984,
          "text": "边界条件从形式上讲总可以通过一系列的因果关系来体现，而且这种因果关系延伸到整个系统模型的内部是合理的，它是系统运动的主要起因，从作用方式上可以将主要起因分为三种：①参数必须被精确赋值来建立系统的精确结构；",
          "section_id": "section_2cbc5db9c64e",
          "start": 882,
          "end": 984,
          "chunk_start": 882,
          "chunk_end": 984,
          "sentence_document_start": 882,
          "sentence_document_end": 984,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_96fc532c87b9d3377944",
          "document_start": 984,
          "document_end": 1013,
          "text": "②对系统内部动力学在特征点进行初始化，即对状态参量赋初值；",
          "section_id": "section_2cbc5db9c64e",
          "start": 984,
          "end": 1013,
          "chunk_start": 984,
          "chunk_end": 1013,
          "sentence_document_start": 984,
          "sentence_document_end": 1013,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_120242fc860af58932b9",
          "document_start": 1013,
          "document_end": 1034,
          "text": "③系统的持续运作往往依赖于系统的输入变量。",
          "section_id": "section_2cbc5db9c64e",
          "start": 1013,
          "end": 1034,
          "chunk_start": 1013,
          "chunk_end": 1034,
          "sentence_document_start": 1013,
          "sentence_document_end": 1034,
          "sentence_complete": true
        }
      ],
